                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "🕹️ Gameplay: ⭐⭐⭐\n📖 Story: ⭐\n🎨 Visuals: ⭐⭐⭐\n🎵 Music: ⭐⭐⭐\n🔄 Replayability: ⭐⭐\n❤️ Enjoyment: ⭐⭐⭐\n\nBit Blaster XL is a simple arcade game that does what it sets out to do well. The gameplay is easy to pick up, and chasing a higher high score kept me entertained. There is not much depth to it, but I still had a good time trying to beat my previous runs.\n\nThere is no story, the music is fine but nothing special, and the visuals do not leave much to discuss given the game's basic arcade style. These elements get the job done without standing out.\n\nUltimately, Bit Blaster XL is a decent little game for anyone who enjoys classic arcade gameplay and high score chasing. It is not something I see myself returning to often, but I had fun with it while it lasted.\n\n⭐ Overall Rating: 3/5",
